        <p>Dr. Williams' Pink Pills Cure.</p>
        <p>Autumn's last days, with their vio!ent changes of temperature, wet morning mists, and chilly foggy evenings. are a source of danger to the susceptible human frame. At this eeason Influenza reappears among the weaklings end quickly works havoc. An instanee, showing what serious results may follow Influenza, is furnished by Mr Jamee Rosenburgh, living at 5 Miles-cottages, Widconahe,Bath. Be related his experience to a press representative in the following words :—" I did not take much notice of the attack when I had Influenza two yearn ago," he said " until I was compelled to. tor an affection of the Heart quickly followed, sad owing to d.ficiency and Poverty of Blood. my health became grea,ly impaired. I was attended by a doctor, but it was not until I was induced to use Dr Williams' pink pills lor pale people that I obtained relief. I suffered for nine months, gradually getting worse, and then I went into hcapital, where my case oame under the notice of two other doctors. My Kidneys were now affected, tor my feet and leos were swollen with Dropsy. My Heart still greatly troubled me, and I was treated for that, but did not improve. In fact I was told at the hospital that ttity could do me DO good, and that I was in a very critical state. after I left the hospital I used to gasp for breath at every movement I made, My legs and feet were still sweln,o, could not go upstairs, labd no i appetite, and was territly weak. People uscd to say I was in a Consumption. All these complications super- vened on Influeiza ; but, as you ran see, I am quite well</p>
