      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1902-10-17_WidnesExaminer_art0097" n="art0097">
        <head>'atriiiitim (the iklrt</head>
        <p>'atriiiitim (the iklrt</p>
        <p>"FORCE"GrvEs FORCE.</p>
        <p>"Bring, therefore, all the forces that you may."</p>
