        <p>_ HOW TO MAKE MONEY WITHOUT MONEY is the title of a valuable little book written by a financial expert, which should be read by every one in search of wealth The writer does not therein advocate gambling on the Stock Exchange or the Turf. He seta forth a variety of legitimate business methods and schemes, open to any man or woman of ordinary intelligence and com- mercial aptitude, in which the investment of their own capital is not necessary. The perusal of such a book by the masses is calculated to serve as an incentive to vast enterprise through- out the country. The anther's main object is to show, in a comprehensive manner, how the want of capital for commercial enterprise can be overcome, and to contradict the fallacy that money can only be made with money. Post free, 1., DIRECT FROM THE PUBLISHERS, on receipt of crossed P. 0., OR TO ORDER through any 13.k,ta1l I 11. Bookseller in the United Kingdom, on producing this advertisement. Published by The Commercial Publishing Company, 26 Aloorgate St, London, S.C.</p>
